  "description": "⭐ <em>After huge success across Europe and the Middle East, </em><strong><em>SENSAS</em></strong><em> has landed in London! Gather your team of 4 to 60 people&nbsp;for a two-hour adventure of pitch-black challenges and vibrant sensory workshops that push the limits of your five senses. Experience shared laughter and connections as you face fears and enjoy a whirlwind of XXL emotions together!</em><br>\n<br>\n💰 <em>Pay in 3 interest-free instalments or Pay in 30 days via Klarna</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\n🖐️ Test all five senses (sight, smell, touch, taste and hearing) in both pitch-black and ultra-colourful workshops<br>\n✨ Gather your team to take on exciting challenges and surprising experiences in the Sensory Labs<br>\n🍀&nbsp;Collect as many sensory charms as possible—each charm means a donation to a local charity supporting people with disabilities<br>\n🤩Feel more: A thrilling sensory journey in complete inmersion&nbsp;<br>\n💖 Perfect for groups of all sizesz<br>\n<br>\n🎁 Gift memories to someone special! Purchase a gift card for&nbsp;SENSAS - A Unique Multi-Sensory Experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://feverup.com/m/272196\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\n📅 Dates and times: select your date &amp; time directly in the ticket selector<br>\n⏳ Duration: 2 hours<br>\n⏰ Please arrive early as <strong>latecomers will be denied access</strong><br>\n📍 Location: London at Arch 17 Miles Street, SW8 1RZ<br>\n👤 Age requirement: 7+<br>\n♿ Accessibility: the venue is wheelchair accessible<br>\n📝 Each team must have at least 4 participants, with a maximum of 60.&nbsp;<strong>For large groups (15+), please find more details </strong><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://sensas-experience.com/groups/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>here</strong></a><br>\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://sensas-experience.com/london/#faqs\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\nStep into the extraordinary world of <em>SENSAS</em>, where fun is shared and your senses—and emotions—are put to the ultimate test! For two thrilling hours, you and your team will dive into a whirlwind of laughter, primal fears, and XXL emotions, navigating between total darkness and ultra-colourful sensory workshops. In teams of 4 to 60, you'll face wild, wacky challenges that push the limits of sight, smell, touch, taste, and hearing—all while collecting sensory charms that support local charities. Guided by the mischievous Master of Senses, <em>SENSAS</em> is all about sharing emotions, learning together, and making a difference as a team in an inclusive, fun-filled adventure. Get your tickets today for <em>SENSAS</em> in London!",
